{"duration":58.07025,"beats":[{"start":0.3,"end":10.471,"sentences":[{"start":0.3,"end":4.164,"text":"Last time, I built a chunk out of two hundred and seventy-five faces.","words":[{"text":"Last","start":0.318,"end":0.568},{"text":"time,","start":0.593,"end":0.918},{"text":"I","start":1.093,"end":1.1680000000000001},{"text":"built","start":1.2180000000000002,"end":1.393},{"text":"a","start":1.4180000000000001,"end":1.443},{"text":"chunk","start":1.518,"end":1.8430000000000002},{"text":"out","start":1.893,"end":1.993},{"text":"of","start":1.993,"end":2.093},{"text":"two","start":2.168,"end":2.368},{"text":"hundred","start":2.418,"end":2.793},{"text":"and","start":2.843,"end":2.918},{"text":"seventy-five","start":2.968,"end":3.568},{"text":"faces.","start":3.618,"end":4.124}]},{"start":4.3839999999999995,"end":8.119,"text":"It looked like this. Like the blueprint for a house nobody will ever build.","words":[{"text":"It","start":4.401999999999999,"end":4.476999999999999},{"text":"looked","start":4.526999999999999,"end":4.702},{"text":"like","start":4.726999999999999,"end":4.877},{"text":"this.","start":4.927,"end":5.202},{"text":"Like","start":5.602,"end":5.727},{"text":"the","start":5.752000000000001,"end":5.8020000000000005},{"text":"blueprint","start":5.852,"end":6.202},{"text":"for","start":6.252000000000001,"end":6.402},{"text":"a","start":6.402,"end":6.452},{"text":"house","start":6.502000000000001,"end":6.777},{"text":"nobody","start":6.852,"end":7.227},{"text":"will","start":7.277,"end":7.402},{"text":"ever","start":7.452,"end":7.652},{"text":"build.","start":7.702,"end":8.079}]},{"start":8.589,"end":10.471,"text":"Today: making it look like Minecraft.","words":[{"text":"Today:","start":8.604,"end":8.929},{"text":"making","start":9.178999999999998,"end":9.404},{"text":"it","start":9.428999999999998,"end":9.479},{"text":"look","start":9.504,"end":9.604},{"text":"like","start":9.629,"end":9.754},{"text":"Minecraft.","start":9.803999999999998,"end":10.431}]}]},{"start":10.921,"end":19.85,"sentences":[{"start":10.921,"end":13.780000000000001,"text":"Step one: turn textures on, without any textures.","words":[{"text":"Step","start":10.936,"end":11.161},{"text":"one:","start":11.210999999999999,"end":11.436},{"text":"turn","start":11.661,"end":11.836},{"text":"textures","start":11.886,"end":12.311},{"text":"on,","start":12.360999999999999,"end":12.511},{"text":"without","start":12.761000000000001,"end":12.961},{"text":"any","start":12.986,"end":13.136000000000001},{"text":"textures.","start":13.186,"end":13.74}]},{"start":14,"end":19.85,"text":"You get this. The magenta checkerboard. The universal sign for: something has gone horribly wrong.","words":[{"text":"You","start":14.018,"end":14.093},{"text":"get","start":14.143,"end":14.293000000000001},{"text":"this.","start":14.343,"end":14.568000000000001},{"text":"The","start":14.868,"end":14.918000000000001},{"text":"magenta","start":14.968,"end":15.418000000000001},{"text":"checkerboard.","start":15.468,"end":16.218},{"text":"The","start":16.518,"end":16.568},{"text":"universal","start":16.618000000000002,"end":17.168},{"text":"sign","start":17.243000000000002,"end":17.543},{"text":"for:","start":17.593,"end":17.868000000000002},{"text":"something","start":18.218,"end":18.543000000000003},{"text":"has","start":18.568,"end":18.693},{"text":"gone","start":18.743000000000002,"end":18.943},{"text":"horribly","start":19.018,"end":19.418000000000003},{"text":"wrong.","start":19.468,"end":19.810000000000002}]}]},{"start":20.4,"end":33.219,"sentences":[{"start":20.4,"end":26.921,"text":"So I generated my own. Eleven textures, sixteen by sixteen pixels, sixty-four colours to pick from.","words":[{"text":"So","start":20.456,"end":20.557},{"text":"I","start":20.605999999999998,"end":20.706},{"text":"generated","start":20.756,"end":21.281},{"text":"my","start":21.331,"end":21.506},{"text":"own.","start":21.557,"end":21.980999999999998},{"text":"Eleven","start":22.281000000000002,"end":22.632},{"text":"textures,","start":22.707,"end":23.306},{"text":"sixteen","start":23.481,"end":23.905},{"text":"by","start":23.955,"end":24.106},{"text":"sixteen","start":24.180999999999997,"end":24.53},{"text":"pixels,","start":24.58,"end":25.055999999999997},{"text":"sixty-four","start":25.230999999999998,"end":25.805},{"text":"colours","start":25.88,"end":26.230999999999998},{"text":"to","start":26.281,"end":26.33},{"text":"pick","start":26.38,"end":26.58},{"text":"from.","start":26.63,"end":26.881}]},{"start":27.141,"end":30.867,"text":"They look like Minecraft if you squint. Hard. With your eyes closed.","words":[{"text":"They","start":27.141,"end":27.209},{"text":"look","start":27.259,"end":27.384},{"text":"like","start":27.409,"end":27.558999999999997},{"text":"Minecraft","start":27.608999999999998,"end":28.058999999999997},{"text":"if","start":28.084,"end":28.159},{"text":"you","start":28.183999999999997,"end":28.259},{"text":"squint.","start":28.308999999999997,"end":28.759},{"text":"Hard.","start":29.109,"end":29.484},{"text":"With","start":29.834,"end":29.934},{"text":"your","start":29.959,"end":30.034000000000002},{"text":"eyes","start":30.084,"end":30.334},{"text":"closed.","start":30.384,"end":30.827}]},{"start":31.337,"end":33.219,"text":"So now, I'm gonna yoink the real ones.","words":[{"text":"So","start":31.351000000000003,"end":31.476000000000003},{"text":"now,","start":31.501,"end":31.751},{"text":"I'm","start":31.926,"end":32.051},{"text":"gonna","start":32.076,"end":32.226},{"text":"yoink","start":32.276,"end":32.501},{"text":"the","start":32.526,"end":32.576},{"text":"real","start":32.626,"end":32.826},{"text":"ones.","start":32.851,"end":33.179}]}]},{"start":33.669000000000004,"end":54.42,"sentences":[{"start":33.669000000000004,"end":39.650000000000006,"text":"Is that legal? Well, Perdix only reads them out of your own copy of Minecraft, every time it starts.","words":[{"text":"Is","start":33.687,"end":33.787},{"text":"that","start":33.837,"e